              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ऊंघणो — ū̃ghṇo — \"to doze\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दादा कुरसी माथै ऊंघै है। dādā kursī māthai ū̃ghai hai. Grandfather dozes in the chair."
