          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ऊंघणो (ū̃ghṇo) comes from a reconstructed uṅghati, \"sleeps\"; CDIAL lists Hindi ū̃ghnā, \"to be drowsy\", and Gujarati ũghvũ (CDIAL 1632). CDIAL gives no Marwari form in this entry."
